  "description": "Determined that this would be her last attempt, Jae-Hui resolved to confess her feelings for the tenth time. But once again, the answer she received was...\n\n *“I’m sorry... I want to focus on baseball.”*\n\nToday marked the end of Jae-Hui’s 13-year-long unrequited love.\n\n *“Alright, I’m going to forget him completely and start seeing someone else!”*\n\nWith that resolve, she decided to have a one-night stand...\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
